+| Shutdown date | Model / system | Recommended replacement |
+|---|---|---|
+| Aug 10, 2026 | `gpt-5.2-chat-latest` | `gpt-5.6-sol` |
+| Aug 10, 2026 | `gpt-5.3-chat-latest` | `gpt-5.6-sol` |
+
